          "Effect": "2 Minutes Out of Combat: Motivate your comrades before a dangerous undertaking. You provide a speech that bolsters the squad's nerves. For the next 1 hour (or until the end of the first combat encounter), all affected allies gain an Advantage Die on Saving Throws and Opposing checks."
        },
