          "Name": "Guidance",
          "Range": "Hearing",
          "Effect": "Provide expert supervision to ensure an ally's success. Instead of making a skill check to aid another, you may provide guidance. This grants a competence bonus on the ally\u2019s skill check equal to your Charisma or Wisdom Modifier. The ally must be within sight and hearing distance and able to understand you."
        }
      ]
